---
// VLM fine-tuning: dataset -> preprocessing -> quantized base VLM + LoRA adapters -> train adapters only -> evaluate -> deploy.
---

<figure class="diagram" data-diagram>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 530" role="img" aria-labelledby="vlm-title vlm-desc">
    <title id="vlm-title">VLM fine-tuning pipeline</title>
    <desc id="vlm-desc">An image-text dataset is preprocessed by formatting, validation, filtering and batching. It trains a quantized base vision-language model with LoRA adapters attached, where only the adapters are trained. After evaluation the result is a deployable quantized model plus a separable LoRA adapter.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="vlm-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path class="arrowhead" d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect class="node" x="140" y="10" width="200" height="44" />
    <text x="240" y="29">Image-text dataset</text>
    <text class="sub" x="240" y="45">custom, per domain</text>

    <path class="edge" d="M240 54 V84" marker-end="url(#vlm-arrow)" />

    <rect class="node" x="100" y="86" width="280" height="62" />
    <text x="240" y="108">Preprocessing</text>
    <text class="sub" x="240" y="128">format · validate · filter · batch</text>

    <path class="edge" d="M240 148 V178" marker-end="url(#vlm-arrow)" />

    <rect class="frame" x="60" y="180" width="360" height="112" />
    <text x="240" y="202">Quantized base VLM</text>
    <text class="sub" x="240" y="218">Int8 or Int4</text>
    <rect class="node hl" x="100" y="232" width="280" height="46" />
    <text x="240" y="252">LoRA adapters</text>
    <text class="sub" x="240" y="268">small low-rank matrices</text>

    <path class="edge" d="M240 292 V322" marker-end="url(#vlm-arrow)" />

    <rect class="node" x="100" y="324" width="280" height="40" />
    <text x="240" y="349">Train adapters only</text>

    <path class="edge" d="M240 364 V394" marker-end="url(#vlm-arrow)" />

    <rect class="node" x="140" y="396" width="200" height="40" />
    <text x="240" y="421">Evaluation</text>

    <path class="edge" d="M240 436 V452 H135 V468" marker-end="url(#vlm-arrow)" />
    <path class="edge" d="M240 452 H345 V468" marker-end="url(#vlm-arrow)" />

    <rect class="node" x="40" y="470" width="190" height="52" />
    <text x="135" y="493">Quantized model</text>
    <text class="sub" x="135" y="510">deployable</text>
    <rect class="node" x="250" y="470" width="190" height="52" />
    <text x="345" y="493">LoRA adapter</text>
    <text class="sub" x="345" y="510">separable, swappable</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>VLM fine-tuning, from custom dataset to quantized model plus adapter.</figcaption>
</figure>
